#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:5
#: ba7ad64e4dc4439388618a41473be461
msgid "Startup Options"
msgstr "启动选项"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:7
#: 779151a3a94749639b8f8989c11d0cb4
msgid "Run a build with -\\-help to see the latest command-line options."
msgstr "使用 -\\-help 运行构建以查看最新的命令行选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:10
#: 83dd5a59b4524c0fabbef3c3ca7431eb
msgid "-\\-serial#"
msgstr "-\\-serial#"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:12
#: 985c3018dc4f4479aa903bc58ea4c147
msgid ""
"This command line argument, with # replaced by a number, is used to connect "
"the an ArduPilot serial port to a serial device or network protocol. May "
"also use old-style(-A, -B, ...)."
msgstr "此命令行参数（将 # 替换为数字）用于将 ArduPilot 串口连接到串行设备或网络协议。也可使用旧式写法（-A、-B 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:15
#: ab5e76abb7f14aa48fb51941ea1be8da
msgid ""
"For each ArduPilot serial port, specify either a device file or a short "
"string to configured the network protocol below. The user account running "
"ardupilot should be added to the dialout group to access serial ports."
msgstr ""
"对于每个 ArduPilot 串口，指定设备文件或下面配置网络协议的短字符串。运行 ardupilot 的用户账户应被添加到 dialout "
"组以访问串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:19
#: 3211f9c76fd84d3cb131ec1ee9b99a52
msgid "Serial Ports: /dev/deviceFile"
msgstr "串口：/dev/deviceFile"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-starting.rst:19
#: 98af52c01f684493b89288dc86db7ad6
msgid "-\\-serial0 /dev/ttyAMA0"
msgstr "-\\-serial0 /dev/ttyAMA0"

